      },
      "message": "fix(mcp): add AI batch undo, get_selection tool, and live confirmation gate\n\nAdd three AI chat safety mechanisms for #1942:\n- Add BatchCommand and History::begin_group/commit_group/cancel_group so a\n  multi-call AI chat turn folds into one Ctrl+Z / Ctrl+Y undo step.\n- Add the read-only get_selection MCP tool reading selected entities,\n  active setup/operation, viewport pick mode, and active geometry picks\n  while keeping ui -> app layering.\n- Add LiveGate, requires_approval, and answer_live_with at live MCP\n  dispatch, forbid auto-approval of posting and machine edits, share the\n  approval rule with AiChatState/transport, and bind Allow clicks to a\n  single-call ApprovedCall.\n\nFixes #1942",
